@startuml seq_007_certification_gates
!include common/seq_styles.puml

title SEQ-007 Certification Gates\n7-Gate Architectural Certification (offline/CI tool)

actor "Optional CI / local client" as cicd
participant "certification_tool\n(offline/CI · not C4 peer)" as AA #A3BE8C
participant "artifacts_repository\n(Object Store)" as SA #81A1C1
database "artifacts\n(Object Store)" as ART #4C566A

autonumber

cicd -> AA: run certification (target_ref / snapshot)
activate AA

group AA-01: Mediated Feedback
    AA -> AA: check mediated feedback model
    note right of AA
        All feedback flows must go
        through the mediation layer,
        not direct mutation.
    end note
end

group AA-02: Declarative Governance
    AA -> AA: check evaluation vs guidance_only
    note right of AA
        Controls must declare their
        governance mode explicitly.
    end note
end

group AA-03: Evaluator Purity
    AA -> AA: check evaluator side-effects
    note right of AA
        Rule evaluators must be pure
        functions. No I/O, no state
        mutation during evaluation.
    end note
end

group AA-04: Segregation of Duties
    AA -> AA: check SoD enforcement
    note right of AA
        Creator cannot approve own
        findings. Author cannot waive
        own violations.
    end note
end

group AA-05: Conflict Determinism
    AA -> AA: check conflict resolution determinism
    note right of AA
        Same inputs must produce
        same resolution. No
        non-deterministic tiebreakers.
    end note
end

group AA-06: Discriminator Completeness
    AA -> AA: check strategy discriminator coverage
    note right of AA
        All control types must have
        complete discriminator chains
        for target classification.
    end note
end

group AA-07: Portability
    AA -> AA: check platform portability
    note right of AA
        RE2-only regex, UTC timestamps,
        finite numbers, no platform-
        specific assumptions.
    end note
end

group Store Certification Artifact
    AA -> SA: store certification artifact
    activate SA
    SA -> ART: write-once put
    ART --> SA: ok
    SA --> AA: artifact stored (artifact_ref)
    deactivate SA
end

AA -> AA: compute CertificationResult
note right of AA
    Result includes:
    - gate pass/fail status
    - per-gate diagnostics
    - overall certification verdict
end note

AA --> cicd: CertificationResult
deactivate AA

note right of AA
    All 7 gates must pass
    for certification to succeed.
    Partial pass is not valid.
    Tool is not an in-process C4 peer.
end note

footer SEQ-007 | Selma Project | Certification Gates

@enduml
